# An allowlist, not a denylist. The build context used to be the whole
# checkout: bench/data alone is 4 GB of benchmark corpora, .venv another half
# gigabyte, and a stray .env or key file would have been sent to the builder
# too. Only what the Dockerfile COPYs is let through.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/
!alembic.ini
!migrations/

# Never ship bytecode or caches from a developer's tree.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
